<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('./partials/head') %>
  <title>Features & Capabilities — Blog App</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Discover the tools and craftsmanship behind Blog App: distraction-free markdown studio, editorial typography, reader engagement, and total content ownership.">
</head>
<body class="bg-body-warm">
  <%- include('./partials/nav') %>
  <header class="py-5 py-lg-6 text-center border-bottom bg-white">
    <div class="container py-lg-3">
      <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 760px;">
        <span class="eyebrow-text d-inline-block mb-2">Platform Capabilities</span>
        <h1 class="hero-headline mb-3" style="font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem);">
          Every tool designed with intentional restraint.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-secondary fs-5 mb-4">
          Publishing without distraction. A platform that prioritizes typography, reader trust, and editorial integrity over algorithmic engagement traps.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center gap-3">
          <a href="/user/signup" class="btn btn-editorial-primary px-4 py-2">Start Writing for Free</a>
          <a href="/pricing" class="btn btn-editorial-outline px-4 py-2">View Membership Plans</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main class="py-5 py-lg-6">
    <div class="container">
      <section class="py-4 py-lg-5">
        <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
          <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
            <span class="eyebrow-text d-block mb-2">01 / The Studio</span>
            <h2 class="section-title mb-3">A writing environment that gets out of the way.</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary mb-4" style="line-height: 1.7;">
              Writing requires sustained concentration. Our studio canvas provides a pristine, uncluttered workspace built on standard Markdown, allowing your fingers to stay on the keyboard and your mind focused on argument and prose.
            </p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrapper flex-shrink-0" style="width: 42px; height: 42px; font-size: 1.15rem;">
                  <i class="bi bi-markdown"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-dark d-block">Native Markdown Toolbar</strong>
                  <span class="text-secondary small">One-click or keyboard formatting for headings, quotes, code blocks, bold, and lists.</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrapper flex-shrink-0" style="width: 42px; height: 42px; font-size: 1.15rem;">
                  <i class="bi bi-eye"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-dark d-block">Instant Live Preview</strong>
                  <span class="text-secondary small">Toggle effortlessly between editing and reader-mode rendering with zero lag.</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrapper flex-shrink-0" style="width: 42px; height: 42px; font-size: 1.15rem;">
                  <i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-dark d-block">Real-Time Word &amp; Reading Cadence</strong>
                  <span class="text-secondary small">Live word counter that calculates estimated reading minutes so you can pace your piece.</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
            <div class="editorial-card p-4 bg-white shadow-sm border">
              <div class="mockup-header-bar d-flex align-items-center gap-1 mb-3 pb-2 border-bottom">
                <div class="mockup-dot"></div>
                <div class="mockup-dot"></div>
                <div class="mockup-dot"></div>
                <span class="text-muted extra-small ms-2">studio.editor — markdown canvas</span>
              </div>
              <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 font-monospace small text-secondary mb-3">
                <span class="text-primary fw-bold">## The Architecture of Clarity</span><br><br>
                Good software does not shout. It creates space for reflection...<br><br>
                <span class="text-success">&gt; "Simplicity is the prerequisite for reliability."</span>
              </div>
              <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center text-muted small pt-2 border-top">
                <span><i class="bi bi-check2 text-success me-1"></i> Draft saved locally</span>
                <span>428 words · 3 min read</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <hr class="my-5 opacity-10">
      <section class="py-4 py-lg-5">
        <div class="row align-items-center g-5 flex-lg-row-reverse">
          <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
            <span class="eyebrow-text d-block mb-2">02 / Typography</span>
            <h2 class="section-title mb-3">Crafted for effortless reading on any screen.</h2>
            <p class="text-secondary mb-4" style="line-height: 1.7;">
              Most web platforms strain readers' eyes with stark white backgrounds, tiny gray fonts, or cramped line-heights. Blog App uses a warm parchment canvas (<code>#faf9f5</code>) and classical serif typography tailored specifically for long-form narrative comprehension.
            </p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrapper flex-shrink-0" style="width: 42px; height: 42px; font-size: 1.15rem;">
                  <i class="bi bi-fonts"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-dark d-block">Newsreader &amp; Plus Jakarta Sans</strong>
                  <span class="text-secondary small">Optical-sized serif for immersion, paired with a crisp contemporary sans for navigation.</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrapper flex-shrink-0" style="width: 42px; height: 42px; font-size: 1.15rem;">
                  <i class="bi bi-aspect-ratio"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-dark d-block">Golden Reading Measure</strong>
                  <span class="text-secondary small">Strictly maintained line width (68 characters max) ensures the human eye never loses its place.</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrapper flex-shrink-0" style="width: 42px; height: 42px; font-size: 1.15rem;">
                  <i class="bi bi-brightness-high"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-dark d-block">High-Contrast Paper Palette</strong>
                  <span class="text-secondary small">Zero blue-glare fatigue. Designed for comfortable reading on phones, tablets, or widescreen monitors.</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
            <div class="editorial-card p-4 p-md-5 bg-white shadow-sm border text-center">
              <div class="display-1 font-serif text-dark mb-3">Aa</div>
              <h3 class="h4 font-serif fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Newsreader Editorial</h3>
              <p class="text-secondary small mb-4 mx-auto" style="max-width: 360px;">
                Designed by Production Type. Proportional rhythm, elegant italic swashes, and distinct numerals.
              </p>
              <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
                <span class="badge text-bg-light border px-3 py-2 text-dark font-serif">Regular 400</span>
                <span class="badge text-bg-light border px-3 py-2 text-dark font-serif fst-italic">Italic 400</span>
                <span class="badge text-bg-light border px-3 py-2 text-dark font-serif fw-semibold">Semibold 600</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <hr class="my-5 opacity-10">
      <section class="py-4 py-lg-5">
        <div class="text-center mx-auto mb-5" style="max-width: 640px;">
          <span class="eyebrow-text d-block mb-2">Complete Toolkit</span>
          <h2 class="section-title mb-3">Built for the entire creative lifecycle.</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary fs-5 mb-0">From initial scratchpad note to publication, community feedback, and public showcase.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
            <div class="editorial-card p-4 h-100 bg-white d-flex flex-column">
              <div class="feature-icon-wrapper mb-3">
                <i class="bi bi-image"></i>
              </div>
              <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">HD Cover Banners</h3>
              <p class="text-secondary small mb-0 flex-grow-1">
                Upload custom high-resolution banner images to set the mood for your story, automatically optimized and scaled.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
            <div class="editorial-card p-4 h-100 bg-white d-flex flex-column">
              <div class="feature-icon-wrapper mb-3">
                <i class="bi bi-heart"></i>
              </div>
              <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Claps &amp; Community Likes</h3>
              <p class="text-secondary small mb-0 flex-grow-1">
                Readers can show genuine appreciation with a single click. No click-farms or manipulative engagement rings.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
            <div class="editorial-card p-4 h-100 bg-white d-flex flex-column">
              <div class="feature-icon-wrapper mb-3">
                <i class="bi bi-chat-text"></i>
              </div>
              <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Civil Discussion Threads</h3>
              <p class="text-secondary small mb-0 flex-grow-1">
                Authentic, threaded reader commentary with verified author badges so writers can converse directly with their audience.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
            <div class="editorial-card p-4 h-100 bg-white d-flex flex-column">
              <div class="feature-icon-wrapper mb-3">
                <i class="bi bi-person-badge"></i>
              </div>
              <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Public Author Profiles</h3>
              <p class="text-secondary small mb-0 flex-grow-1">
                A personal showcase displaying your bio, avatar, location, social/website links, and full back-catalog of published essays.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
            <div class="editorial-card p-4 h-100 bg-white d-flex flex-column">
              <div class="feature-icon-wrapper mb-3">
                <i class="bi bi-tags"></i>
              </div>
              <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Topics &amp; Deep Search</h3>
              <p class="text-secondary small mb-0 flex-grow-1">
                Automatic tag organization and real-time keyword discovery across Technology, Design, Business, Culture, and Science.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
            <div class="editorial-card p-4 h-100 bg-white d-flex flex-column">
              <div class="feature-icon-wrapper mb-3">
                <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
              </div>
              <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-dark mb-2">100% Content Ownership</h3>
              <p class="text-secondary small mb-0 flex-grow-1">
                Your writing belongs exclusively to you. No restrictive rights grabs, no platform lock-in, and zero paywall hostage tricks.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="mt-5 pt-lg-4">
        <div class="editorial-card p-5 text-center bg-dark text-white rounded-4 shadow-sm">
          <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 620px;">
            <span class="eyebrow-text d-inline-block text-white-50 mb-2">Get Started</span>
            <h2 class="h2 font-serif mb-3 text-white">Experience publishing the way it was meant to be.</h2>
            <p class="text-white-50 mb-4">
              Join a community of thoughtful writers, researchers, and creators sharing perspective without the noise.
            </p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center gap-3">
              <a href="/user/signup" class="btn btn-light fw-semibold px-4 py-2">Create Free Account</a>
              <a href="/#explore" class="btn btn-outline-light px-4 py-2">Explore Stories</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <footer class="footer py-5 border-top bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between align-items-center gap-3">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
          <span class="fw-bold font-serif text-dark fs-5">Blog App</span>
          <span class="text-muted small ms-2">© 2026 Blog App Inc.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex gap-4 small flex-wrap justify-content-center">
          <a href="/" class="footer-link">Home</a>
          <a href="/features" class="footer-link fw-bold text-dark">Features</a>
          <a href="/pricing" class="footer-link">Pricing</a>
          <a href="/about" class="footer-link">About</a>
          <a href="/privacy" class="footer-link">Privacy</a>
          <a href="/terms" class="footer-link">Terms</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
  <%- include('./partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
